mkpdf is an independent implementation. It is being written from public standards and
specifications (ISO 32000-1 and ISO 32000-2, and referenced standards), with AI
assistance. There is no known copying of code from other PDF libraries. No provenance
audit has been done yet, and the code has not had independent human review. See
docs/dependencies.md and docs/risk/register.md.

Third-party components that are redistributed with mkpdf, and their notices, are listed in
docs/dependencies.md. At the time of writing there are none.
